%% title: Standing Order Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ACTIVE : POST /standing-orders (start_date set, next_execution_date = start_date)

    ACTIVE --> PAUSED : POST /{id}/pause (operator / customer request)
    PAUSED --> ACTIVE : POST /{id}/resume

    ACTIVE --> CANCELLED : DELETE /{id}
    PAUSED --> CANCELLED : DELETE /{id}

    ACTIVE --> COMPLETED : end_date reached or last execution processed
    ACTIVE --> FAILED : execution_count max failures exceeded

    CANCELLED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]

    note right of ACTIVE
        Each execution: next_execution_date advances by frequency,
        execution_count++, last_execution_date updated.
        Actual payment triggered downstream (transaction-service).
    end note
